# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the two values from your Supabase
# dashboard, under Project Settings.
#
# BOTH of these are safe. They are sent to every browser that opens the app,
# so they are not secrets and committing them would not expose anything.
# .env.local is still kept out of git as a matter of habit.
#
# NEVER put the service_role key, the secret key, or the database password in
# this file or any other file in this repository. Those grant full admin access
# and bypass every security rule.

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
